    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Welcome to No.17 Chapel Manor. Dowling Property is delighted to present to the market, this superior, A2 rated, 3 bedroom semi-detached home for sale. Presented in excellent condition throughout this modern home enjoys being located on a corner site and boasts a large rear garden, side entrance and front garden. \r\n\r\nExtending to c.113 sq.mt. this energy efficient home boasts an impressive feature list which includes air to water heating, large utility, 3 double bedrooms, guest w.c. and an en-suite. The sitting room is dual aspect and overlooks a well kept green to the front. There is an extensive fitted kitchen with integrated appliances and all complete with centre island. The attic is also floored and shelved and truly maximises storage.\r\n\r\nThe real highlight is the exterior gardens, front and rear which are large, private and tastefully landscaped. There is off-street parking for 2 cars to front on a cobble lock driveway. The location is simply 1st class with all amenities within walking distance. Excellent access to the city can be found close by with the N81 and M9/M7. With its superior A2 energy rating, large corner site and location, we must now advise on early viewings as we are predicting strong interest in the wonderful home. One Not To Be Missed!!"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "The accommodation which is bright and spacious and well laid out, consists of entrance hallway, cloakroom, guest w.c, sitting room, kitchen/dining room and utility. Upstairs are 3 double bedrooms with master en-suite and family bathroom.\r\n\r\nAll amenities are on your doorstep including Centra, Chemist, Doyle's Butchers, church's, primary and secondary schools and public houses. Dunlavin is at the front hills of the Wicklow mountains where you will find a host of leisure activities."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Rooms",
        "SortOrder": 2,
        "Content": "Entrance Hallway - 4.5m x 2.04m \r\nA most welcoming hallway with wide plank wooden floor and convenient cloakroom.\r\n\r\nGuest W.C. - 1.67m x 1.36m \r\nGenerous sized guest w.c. with tiled floor, w.c. and wash hand basin.\r\n\r\nSitting Room (Max Measure Into Bay) - 4.21m x 5.89m \r\nA real highlight of this superb home in this large and bright sitting room enjoying a dual aspect with bay window. Wide plank wooden floor.\r\n\r\nKitchen/Dining Room - 4.88m x 4.3m \r\nThe heartbeat of this home is the spacious, dual aspect kitchen/dining room with a tasteful fitted kitchen with integrated oven & hob, dishwasher, fridge/freezer and all complete with centre island. Tiled floor and part tiled walls. Feature gable window and full length sliding patio doors allowing you to enjoy the private rear garden.\r\n\r\nUtility Room - 1.92m x 1.67m \r\nA good sized utility room with tiled floor and plumbed for washing machine and dryer. Storage area built-in.\r\n\r\nUpstairs Landing - \r\nA generous sized landing area with laundry store room. Attic access via drop down ladder.\r\n\r\nMaster Bed (Front) - 3.5m x 3.22m \r\nThis master bedroom is bright and spacious and enjoys elevated views of green to front. Built-in wardrobes.\r\n\r\nEn-Suite - 2.41m x 1.41m \r\nA well presented en-suite with double step-in shower, tiled floor, wash hand basin with storage built-in and w.c.\r\n\r\nBathroom - 2.41m x 2.66m \r\nThe family bathroom has tiled floor and walls, bath, wash hand basin with storage and w.c.\r\n\r\nAttic - \r\nFully floored and shelved to maximise storage. Drop down wooden ladder and electricity supply.\r\n\r\nBed 2 (Rear) - 3.62m x 3.18m \r\nDouble bedroom with built-in wardrobes. Wide plank wooden floor.\r\n\r\nBed 3 (Rear) - 2.91m x 2.94m \r\nDouble bedrooms with wide plank wooden floor.\r\n\r\nOutside Front - 14.26m x 9.34m \r\nA most impressive front garden enjoying a corner end site with large gated side entrance. Overlooks a well maintained green. Tastefully landscaped with box hedging and lawn area. Cobble Lock driveway with parking x 2 cars.\r\n\r\nRear - 12.37m x 14.87m \r\nA real highlight of this superior home is the large rear garden which extends to c.15 metres in width and is not overlooked. Part walled with extensive lawn area. Large patio area with outside electrical sockets.\r\n\r\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Excellent Condition Throughout\r\nLarge Corner Site Position\r\nA2 Rated\r\nAir To Water Heating\r\nExtremely Large Rear Garden & Side Entrance\r\nAccommodation Extends To c.113 Sq.Mt.\r\nGuest W.C.\r\nMaster Bed En-Suite\r\nUtility Room\r\nTreble Glazed Windows\r\nQuiet Cul-De-Sac\r\nWalking Distance To All Amenities\r\nOff-Street Parking x 2 Cars On Cobble Lock Drive\r\nAttic Is Floored & Shelved With Drop Down Ladder\r\nOverlooks Green To Front"
      },
